  "source": "function tasNew = interp_tas(tasValues) % interpolate TAS if bad values exist ~ Added by Joe Finlon 11/3/19\n\ntasNew = tasValues;\ngood = find((tasValues>0) & ~isnan(tasValues)); bad = find((tasValues==0) | isnan(tasValues));\nif ~isempty(bad)\n    tasNew(bad) = interp1(good, tasValues(good), bad);\nend\n\nend\n"
